WEBVTT

00:00.501 --> 00:05.735
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:07.235 --> 00:09.001
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

00:09.001 --> 00:13.068
- [growling]
- Why couldn't I see it before?
- [咆哮]
- 为什么我之前看不到？

00:13.068 --> 00:15.835
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

00:15.835 --> 00:17.235
- [laughing maliciously]
- [恶意地笑]

00:17.235 --> 00:20.568
The way to get the Krabby Patty
formula was so obvious.
获取蟹黄饼的方法
公式是如此明显。

00:20.568 --> 00:22.668
Spend an inordinate amount
of time
花费过多的金额
时间的

00:22.668 --> 00:25.701
training several dozen sea bears
to take over your restaurant
训练数十只海熊
接管你的餐馆

00:25.701 --> 00:27.401
and force you
to give it up.
并强迫你
放弃它。

00:27.401 --> 00:31.101
Nothing can turn them
from their central purpose!
没有什么可以改变他们
从他们的中心目标出发！

00:31.101 --> 00:32.368
- Yoo-hoo.
- 哟吼。

00:32.368 --> 00:34.335
Who wants their tummies
tickled?
谁想要自己的肚子
痒痒了吗？

00:34.335 --> 00:36.735
- No! My weapons!
Ouch!
- 不！我的武器！
哎哟!

00:36.735 --> 00:39.268
- Sea bears aren't weapons,
Plankton.
- 海熊不是武器，
浮游生物。

00:39.268 --> 00:41.135
They're furry
buckets of love.
它们毛茸茸的
一桶桶的爱。

00:41.135 --> 00:42.601
[laughs]
See?
[笑]
看到了吗？

00:42.601 --> 00:46.135
And what do sea bears love more
than tummy tickles?
海熊更喜欢什么
比肚子痒？

00:46.135 --> 00:48.268
Jellyfish honey.
海蜇蜜。

00:51.035 --> 00:54.001
Come and get it.
快过来取。

00:54.001 --> 00:55.335
- No, come back!
- 不，回来吧！

00:55.335 --> 00:57.535
- Why do you keep
doing this, Plankton?
- 你为什么保留
做这个吗，浮游生物？

00:57.535 --> 01:00.468
When you mess with me business,
you mess with me money!
当你扰乱我的生意时
你拿我钱来乱搞！

01:00.468 --> 01:02.735
- Money's not everything,
you know?
- 金钱不是万能的
你知道吗？

01:02.735 --> 01:04.001
- Course it is!
- 当然是！

01:04.001 --> 01:06.135
Money makes the world
go round
金钱创造世界
绕圈

01:06.135 --> 01:08.235
and makes me heart
go pound.
让我心动
去磅吧。

01:08.235 --> 01:10.268
- Well, if you love money
so much,
- 好吧，如果你爱钱
就这么多，

01:10.268 --> 01:12.335
why don't you marry it?
你为什么不嫁给它呢？

01:14.501 --> 01:15.868
- If I could,
I would.
- 如果我可以的话
我会的。

01:15.868 --> 01:18.635
- Would you now?
[laughing maliciously]
- 现在你愿意吗？
[恶意大笑]

01:18.635 --> 01:20.535
- You still here?
- Aah!
- 你还在吗？
- 啊啊！

01:20.535 --> 01:23.935
This gives me an idea.
Ow!
这给了我一个想法。
噢！

01:26.835 --> 01:28.335
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

01:28.335 --> 01:30.301
Another lonely evening...
又是一个孤独的夜晚……

01:30.301 --> 01:34.035
dumping trash...alone.
独自倾倒垃圾。

01:34.035 --> 01:36.235
- [crying]
- Huh?
- [哭泣]
- 啊？

01:36.235 --> 01:37.235
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

01:37.235 --> 01:38.535
- Um...
- 嗯...

01:38.535 --> 01:41.268
Hello? Miss?
- [crying]
你好？错过？
- [哭泣]

01:46.035 --> 01:47.835
Ooh, careful now.
Careful.
哦，现在小心点。
小心。

01:47.835 --> 01:50.368
Your ink will run.
你的墨水会流掉。

01:50.368 --> 01:52.835
- My, you're
such a gentleman.
- 天哪，你是
这样的一位绅士。

01:52.835 --> 01:54.735
- [chuckles nervously]
Yeah, well.
- [紧张地笑]
是的，好吧。

01:54.735 --> 01:59.401
So, uh, what's a nice
denomination like you doing...
那么，呃，什么是好的
像你这样的教派...

01:59.401 --> 02:00.768
on a bench like this?
在这样的长凳上？

02:00.768 --> 02:03.968
- My date was supposed
to bring me to the bank,
- 我的约会本来是
带我去银行

02:03.968 --> 02:06.235
but he stood me up.
但他让我站起来。

02:06.235 --> 02:07.635
- What?
- 什么？

02:07.635 --> 02:09.601
Hey, if I met the scallywag
that stood you up,
嘿，如果我遇到了那个恶棍
让你站起来，

02:09.601 --> 02:11.901
I'd knock him down.
我会把他击倒。

02:11.901 --> 02:13.435
Ooh!
哦！

02:13.435 --> 02:16.501
- My knight
in shinning exoskeleton.
- 我的骑士
在闪亮的外骨骼中。

02:16.501 --> 02:19.935
- Name's Krabs,
Eugene Krabs.
- 名字叫螃蟹，
尤金·克拉布斯.

02:19.935 --> 02:21.068
And yours?
你的呢？

02:21.068 --> 02:24.101
- Cashina.
You're very sweet.
- 卡希纳。
你很可爱。

02:24.101 --> 02:25.535
- You know something?
- 你知道什么吗？

02:25.535 --> 02:28.235
You look like a million bucks
when you smile.
你看起来像百万富翁
当你微笑时。

02:28.235 --> 02:29.801
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

02:29.801 --> 02:32.235
- Cashina, would you make
this old crab's day
- Cashina，你会做吗
这个老螃蟹的日子

02:32.235 --> 02:33.868
and allow me to take you
to a place
让我带你去
到一个地方

02:33.868 --> 02:35.401
where you can
buy me dinner?
你可以在哪里
请我吃饭？

02:35.401 --> 02:36.901
- I'd love to.
- 我喜欢。

02:36.901 --> 02:39.535
Scam you out of your
secret formula, that is.
骗你出你的
秘密公式，就是。

02:39.535 --> 02:41.935
[laughing maliciously]
[恶意大笑]

02:41.935 --> 02:43.701
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

02:45.368 --> 02:48.501
[both chuckling]
[两人都笑了]

02:50.335 --> 02:51.735
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:58.435 --> 02:59.801
- Whoa!
- 哇！

02:59.801 --> 03:02.235
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

03:02.235 --> 03:04.101
- Allow me.
- 请允许我。

03:04.101 --> 03:06.001
- This food is so delicious.
- 这食物真好吃。

03:06.001 --> 03:10.068
Oop, you don't suppose it has
a secret formula.
哎呀，你不认为它有
一个秘密公式。

03:10.068 --> 03:14.035
I don't suppose you know
anything about secrets...
我想你不知道
任何关于秘密的事情...

03:14.035 --> 03:15.568
or formulas.
或公式。

03:15.568 --> 03:19.368
- Ooh, I do have
a very special recipe.
- 哦，我有
一个非常特别的食谱。

03:19.368 --> 03:23.001
- Yes?
- For delicious kisses.
- 是的？
- 美妙的吻。

03:23.001 --> 03:24.235
- Ugh.
- 呃。

03:24.235 --> 03:27.035
- Cashina, would you mind
if I kissed you?
-卡西娜，你介意吗
如果我吻你了？

03:27.035 --> 03:30.235
- Oh, Eugene.
This is all moving so fast.
- 哦，尤金。
这一切进展得如此之快。

03:30.235 --> 03:32.835
Just as I planned.
[laughs]
正如我计划的那样。
[笑]

03:32.835 --> 03:34.335
- Be gentle.
- 温柔点。

03:34.335 --> 03:35.868
- Purse lips.
- 钱包嘴唇。

03:37.268 --> 03:39.135
[electricity zapping]
[电击]

03:39.135 --> 03:41.035
- Wow!
What a woman.
- 哇！
真是个女人啊。

03:41.035 --> 03:44.035
- [groans]
Well, I finally did it.
- [呻吟]
好吧，我终于做到了。

03:44.035 --> 03:46.035
I kissed a crab.
我亲吻了一只螃蟹。

03:47.635 --> 03:50.701
- [laughing happily]
- [开心地笑]

03:52.135 --> 03:53.735
Ooh, Cashina.
哦，卡希纳。

03:53.735 --> 03:55.901
- Daddy, I want to--
Ew!
- 爸爸，我想要--
呃！

03:55.901 --> 03:59.235
Are you kissing a locket
with a woman's picture in it?
你在亲吻吊坠吗
里面有一张女人的照片？

03:59.235 --> 04:01.601
- Oh, no! No!
I was, uh--
- 哦，不！不！
我当时，呃——

04:01.601 --> 04:05.301
I was polishing this jewelry
with me mouth hole.
我正在抛光这件珠宝
与我口洞。

04:05.301 --> 04:09.268
You see? Like this...
[smooching]
你看？像这样...
[接吻]

04:09.268 --> 04:11.435
- Gross!
- 总的！

04:11.435 --> 04:13.001
- Pearl, me little beluga,
- 珍珠，我的小白鲸，

04:13.001 --> 04:14.435
I never thought
I'd say this,
我从没想过
我想说的是，

04:14.435 --> 04:17.235
but I may have found you
a new mom.
但我可能找到了你
一位新妈妈。

04:17.235 --> 04:18.601
- No way!
- 决不！

04:18.601 --> 04:21.035
I have seen stepmoms
in movies, Dad.
我见过继母
在电影里，爸爸。

04:21.035 --> 04:23.001
She'll make me sweep up
the cinders,
她会让我扫地
煤渣，

04:23.001 --> 04:25.268
and then she won't let me go
to the ball,
然后她不会让我走
到球，

04:25.268 --> 04:29.235
and then I'll never meet
my Prince Charming.
然后我就永远不会见面了
我的白马王子。

04:29.235 --> 04:31.235
[crying]
[哭泣]

04:31.235 --> 04:33.401
- You know, we're gonna have
to have another talk
- 你知道，我们将会有
再谈一次

04:33.401 --> 04:35.568
about fantasy and reality.
关于幻想和现实。

04:35.568 --> 04:37.501
- Okay,
then what's she like?
- 好吧，
那她是什么样的人呢？

04:37.501 --> 04:42.235
- Well, she's everything
I've ever wanted in a woman.
- 好吧，她就是一切
我曾经想要一个女人。

04:42.235 --> 04:44.401
- Blech!
- Oh, don't worry, sweetie.
- 布莱奇！
-哦，别担心，亲爱的。

04:44.401 --> 04:45.901
Nothing will ever come
between us.
什么都不会到来
我们之间。

04:45.901 --> 04:48.901
[doorbell rings]
Oh, she's here! Out of me way!
[门铃响]
哦，她来了！别挡我的路！

04:48.901 --> 04:51.035
Hello, me little
money stack.
你好我小
钱栈。

04:51.035 --> 04:53.435
I want you to meet
me daughter, Pearl.
我想让你见见
我的女儿，珀尔。

04:53.435 --> 04:55.935
- Pearl, I love
your rouge.
- 珍珠，我爱
你的胭脂。

04:55.935 --> 04:58.335
How chic!
- It's actually a rash.
多别致啊！
- 这实际上是皮疹。

04:58.335 --> 05:01.235
- Uh...
teen talk, teen talk.
- 呃...
青少年谈话，青少年谈话。

05:01.235 --> 05:02.401
Uh, girls like shoes.
呃，女孩子都喜欢鞋子。

05:02.401 --> 05:05.101
Well, Pearl.
I love your shoes.
嗯，珍珠。
我喜欢你的鞋子。

05:05.101 --> 05:07.235
- I'm not wearing shoes.
- 我没穿鞋。

05:07.235 --> 05:08.801
Those are barnacles.
那些是藤壶。

05:08.801 --> 05:11.835
- Oh, uh,
I have some cream for that.
- 哦，呃，
我有一些奶油。

05:11.835 --> 05:14.268
- Stop trying to mom at me,
lady!
- 别再对我当妈妈了
女士！

05:14.268 --> 05:15.768
I don't need you.
我不需要你。

05:15.768 --> 05:17.935
- Well, Pearl,
since I'm seeing your father,
- 嗯，珍珠，
自从我见到你父亲

05:17.935 --> 05:20.401
I hope we can learn
to understand each other.
我希望我们能够学习
互相理解。

05:20.401 --> 05:22.868
- You'll never
understand me!
- 你永远不会
理解我！

05:22.868 --> 05:25.001
In fact, I'm going
to make it a point
事实上，我要去
使它成为一个要点

05:25.001 --> 05:27.668
to never be
understandable again.
永远不会
又可以理解了。

05:27.668 --> 05:31.601
Blarb snobble goober blab!
胡言乱语势利古柏胡言乱语！

05:31.601 --> 05:34.301
- Eh, let me talk to her.
- No.
- 呃，让我跟她谈谈。
- 不。

05:34.301 --> 05:36.135
I think I should do this alone.
我想我应该独自完成这件事。

05:37.568 --> 05:39.701
- Oh, I haven't been
this nervous
-哦，我没去过
这紧张

05:39.701 --> 05:41.835
since me first boatswain's ball.
自从我第一次参加水手长舞会以来。

05:41.835 --> 05:43.835
- And I was all,
"You call this a mugging?"
- 而我就是全部，
“你管这叫抢劫？”

05:43.835 --> 05:46.668
And then I suplexed him
until he gave me my purse back.
然后我就让他陷入困境
直到他把钱包还给我。

05:46.668 --> 05:48.001
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

05:48.001 --> 05:50.401
- Hey, you two,
how about inviting me
- 嘿，你们两个，
邀请我怎么样

05:50.401 --> 05:52.701
into your inside joke, eh?
进入你的内心笑话，嗯？

05:52.701 --> 05:54.635
- Oh, you wouldn't get it,
Dad.
- 哦，你不会明白的，
爸爸。

05:54.635 --> 05:56.468
It's a girl thing.
这是一个女孩的事情。

05:56.468 --> 05:58.235
- Cashina,
you know I love you,
- 卡希纳,
你知道我爱你，

05:58.235 --> 06:00.568
and now me daughter
loves you too.
现在是我的女儿
也爱你。

06:00.568 --> 06:02.568
Will you marry me,
Cashina?
你愿意嫁给我吗
卡什纳？

06:02.568 --> 06:05.568
[romantic music]
[浪漫音乐]

06:05.568 --> 06:08.568
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

06:08.568 --> 06:12.235
- Yes! Yes, yes!
- 是的！是的，是的！

06:12.235 --> 06:13.268
Perfect!
完美的！

06:13.268 --> 06:14.635
When we're married,
当我们结婚的时候，

06:14.635 --> 06:16.535
he'll have to tell me
the secret formula.
他必须告诉我
秘密公式。

06:16.535 --> 06:18.235
[laughs maliciously]
Yeah!
[恶意地笑]
是啊！

06:19.935 --> 06:22.101
- SpongeBob, you're gonna be
me wedding planner.
- 海绵宝宝，你会的
我的婚礼策划师。

06:22.101 --> 06:23.901
- I'm so honored,
Mr. Krabs.
- 我很荣幸
蟹老板。

06:23.901 --> 06:25.568
- Great!
Here's your budget.
- 伟大的！
这是您的预算。

06:25.568 --> 06:27.735
- Mr. Krabs,
I am gonna stretch this dollar
- 蟹老板先生，
我要花点钱

06:27.735 --> 06:30.001
until it begs
for mercy.
直到它乞求
为了怜悯。

06:30.001 --> 06:32.335
No disrespect
to your new bride.
没有不尊重
给你的新新娘。

06:32.335 --> 06:35.335
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

06:35.335 --> 06:43.268
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

06:48.801 --> 06:52.401
Would you like our house red
or our house yellow?
你想要我们的房子是红色的吗
还是我们的房子是黄色的？

06:52.401 --> 06:54.068
[laughing]
[笑]

06:58.601 --> 06:59.768
Ta-da!
哒哒！

06:59.768 --> 07:03.501
[wedding march]
[婚礼进行曲]

07:03.501 --> 07:04.901
- [clears throat]
- [清喉咙]

07:04.901 --> 07:07.301
And now the couple
will exchange their vows.
而现在这对夫妇
将交换誓言。

07:07.301 --> 07:10.901
- Eugene, you have everything
I ever wanted in a man:
- 尤金，你拥有一切
我曾经想要一个男人：

07:10.901 --> 07:14.768
an exoskeleton,
freakishly long eye stalks,
外骨骼，
长得奇特的眼柄，

07:14.768 --> 07:17.035
and the secret
Krabby Patty formula.
和秘密
蟹黄饼配方。

07:17.035 --> 07:18.835
all: Aw!
全体：噢！

07:18.835 --> 07:21.468
- Cashina,
you came into my life
- 卡希纳,
你进入了我的生活

07:21.468 --> 07:24.235
when I thought I'd live
the rest of it alone.
当我以为我能活着的时候
剩下的就单独说了。

07:24.235 --> 07:26.801
You showed me
once and for all
你向我展示了
一劳永逸

07:26.801 --> 07:30.401
that while money
can't buy you love,
那虽然钱
买不到你的爱，

07:30.401 --> 07:32.968
it can give you love.
它可以给你爱。

07:32.968 --> 07:34.801
all: Aw!
全体：噢！

07:34.801 --> 07:38.101
- You may now
kiss the bride.
- 你现在可以
亲吻新娘。

07:38.101 --> 07:39.768
[both smooching]
[两人接吻]

07:39.768 --> 07:42.101
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

07:42.101 --> 07:43.968
- Oh, no!
What about the bouquet?
- 哦，不！
花束呢？

07:43.968 --> 07:47.768
- Uh, one bouquet
coming up, Mrs. Krabs!
- 呃，一束
来了，蟹老板夫人！

07:49.068 --> 07:50.368
all: Huh?
全体：啊？

07:50.368 --> 07:51.368
all: Huh?
全体：啊？

07:51.368 --> 07:53.001
- Huh?
- 啊？

07:53.001 --> 07:53.801
- Catch!
- 抓住！

07:53.801 --> 07:54.935
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

07:56.035 --> 07:59.035
- [muffled]
Hooray! I win!
- [低声]
万岁！我赢了！

07:59.035 --> 08:00.101
[burps]
[打嗝]

08:00.101 --> 08:03.035
[all crying]
[都哭了]

08:04.901 --> 08:07.635
- It's a shame
Plankton couldn't be here.
- 真可惜
浮游生物不可能在这里。

08:09.768 --> 08:12.235
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

08:12.235 --> 08:15.768
Who knew Eugene was
so light on his crab legs?
谁知道尤金是
他的蟹腿这么轻吗？

08:15.768 --> 08:16.901
[retches]
[干呕]

08:19.668 --> 08:23.535
[both giggling]
[两人都咯咯笑]

08:23.535 --> 08:24.835
- Okay.
- 好的。

08:27.701 --> 08:29.635
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

08:29.635 --> 08:31.101
Eugene,
尤金,

08:31.101 --> 08:32.801
I don't want there to be
any secrets between us.
我不想有
我们之间的任何秘密。

08:32.801 --> 08:34.801
- What?
Oh!
- 什么？
哦！

08:34.801 --> 08:35.901
I'll tell you everything,
我会告诉你一切

08:35.901 --> 08:37.468
no matter how embarrassing.
不管多么尴尬。

08:37.468 --> 08:39.035
I wet me bed
till I was 40.
我尿湿了床
直到我40岁。

08:39.035 --> 08:41.168
Me armpits sweat smells like
tartar sauce when I'm afraid.
我腋下有汗味
当我害怕的时候，塔塔酱。

08:41.168 --> 08:43.335
- Not those kinds
of secrets.
- 不是那些类型
的秘密。

08:43.335 --> 08:44.568
- Ooh, okay.
- 哦，好吧。

08:44.568 --> 08:46.868
Whatever you want,
me sweet, just ask.
无论你想要什么，
我亲爱的，就问吧。

08:46.868 --> 08:48.501
- I want you to tell me...
- 我想让你告诉我...

08:48.501 --> 08:50.268
the secret Krabby Patty
formula.
秘密的克拉比帕蒂
公式。

08:50.268 --> 08:51.268
- The what?
- 什么？

08:51.268 --> 08:52.335
- The secret formula
- 秘密配方

08:52.335 --> 08:53.635
is locked away
in your heart.
被锁起来
在你心里。

08:53.635 --> 08:56.201
Unlock your heart
for me, Eugene.
解锁你的心
对我来说，尤金。

08:56.201 --> 08:57.635
Let me in.
让我进去。

08:57.635 --> 08:59.435
- Oh. Okay.
- 哦。好的。

08:59.435 --> 09:00.835
Anything for you,
baby.
为你做任何事，
宝贝。

09:03.668 --> 09:05.301
I'm gonna whisper it
to you,
我会轻声说
对你来说，

09:05.301 --> 09:08.501
just in case there's
any prying ears out there.
以防万一
那里有任何窥探的耳朵。

09:08.501 --> 09:11.468
- Oh, boy.
Here it comes!
- 哦，男孩。
它来了！

09:11.468 --> 09:15.068
- All right, my sweet.
Here it is.
- 好吧，亲爱的。
这里是。

09:15.068 --> 09:18.001
I'm getting a little
emotional here.
我有点
这里有情感。

09:18.001 --> 09:19.235
You know,
I never told anyone
你知道，
我从未告诉过任何人

09:19.235 --> 09:21.868
the secret Krabby Patty
formula before.
秘密的克拉比帕蒂
之前的公式。

09:21.868 --> 09:24.368
So...here goes.
那么...就这样吧。

09:27.635 --> 09:28.768
[electricity zapping]
[电击]

09:31.601 --> 09:35.668
- Come on, Krabs.
Let it all out.
- 来吧，蟹蟹。
把一切都释放出来。

09:35.668 --> 09:37.635
Uh!
- Plankton?
呃！
- 浮游生物？

09:37.635 --> 09:41.101
- No, no! I'm not Plankton.
I'm Cashina.
- 不，不！我不是浮游生物。
我是卡西娜。

09:41.101 --> 09:43.001
[laughs]
Your blushing bride.
[笑]
你的新娘脸红了。

09:43.001 --> 09:45.668
I'm, uh, uh--
am I blushing?
我是，呃，呃——
我脸红了吗？

09:45.668 --> 09:47.068
- You...
- 你...

09:47.068 --> 09:48.468
monster!
怪物！

09:48.468 --> 09:50.268
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:50.268 --> 09:52.901
Argh!
啊！

09:52.901 --> 09:56.001
- Y-y-you're not gonna
crush me?
- 你-你-你不会的
压垮我？

09:56.001 --> 09:58.901
- Oh, I've been alone
for so long.
- 哦，我一直孤身一人
这么久了。

09:58.901 --> 10:01.001
And for the first time
in forever,
并且是第一次
在永远，

10:01.001 --> 10:02.901
I felt for someone.
我对某人有感觉。

10:02.901 --> 10:04.101
Well, something.
嗯，有什么。

10:04.101 --> 10:05.768
Well, I mean,
a pile of cash with lips.
嗯，我的意思是，
一堆现金与嘴唇。

10:05.768 --> 10:08.701
It was all
too good to be true.
这就是全部
好得令人难以置信。

10:08.701 --> 10:10.968
Cashina may have not
been real,
卡希纳可能还没有
曾经是真实的，

10:10.968 --> 10:12.601
but me feelings were.
但我的感受是。

10:12.601 --> 10:15.735
Weren't they?
- Get ahold of yourself, Krabs.
不是吗？
- 控制住自己，蟹蟹。

10:15.735 --> 10:19.235
- Plankton, are you saying
it was all just a scheme to you?
- 浮游生物，你是说
这对你来说只是一个计划吗？

10:19.235 --> 10:22.001
You felt nothing?
- You're crazy!
你什么感觉都没有吗？
- 你疯了！

10:22.001 --> 10:23.135
I'm out of here!
我要离开这里了！

10:23.135 --> 10:26.401
And one day, that formula
will be mine!
有一天，这个公式
将是我的！

10:26.401 --> 10:27.401
Mark it!
标记它！

10:29.435 --> 10:32.368
- [weeping]
- [哭泣]

10:33.601 --> 10:36.535
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

10:39.835 --> 10:41.368
- Oh, hey, buddy.
- 哦，嘿，伙计。

10:41.368 --> 10:42.535
I want you to know,
我想让你知道，

10:42.535 --> 10:45.468
even though your wife
just ran out on you,
即使你的妻子
刚刚摆脱了你，

10:45.468 --> 10:47.335
you still have
to tip me.
你还有
给我小费。

你还有
给我小费。